'>{}</span>", "ja496:18.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja496:19.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja496:19.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja496:19.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja496:19.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja496:20.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja496:20.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja496:20.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja496:20.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja496:21.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p>", "ja496:22.1": "<p class='endsection'>{}</p>", "ja496:23.1": "<p class='uddana-intro'>{}</p>", "ja496:24.1": "<blockquote class='uddanagatha'><p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja496:24.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja496:24.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja496:24.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja496:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja496:0.2": "Pakiṇṇakanipāta ", "ja496:0.3": "Sālikedāravagga ", "ja496:0.4": "13. Bhikkhāparamparajātaka ", "ja496:1.1": "“Sukhumālarūpaṁ disvā, ", "ja496:1.2": "raṭṭhā vivanamāgataṁ; ", "ja496:1.3": "Kūṭāgāravarūpetaṁ, ", "ja496:1.4": "mahāsayanamupāsitaṁ. ", "ja496:2.1": "Tassa te pemakenāhaṁ, ", "ja496:2.2": "adāsiṁ vaḍḍhamodanaṁ; ", "ja496:2.3": "Sālīnaṁ vicitaṁ bhattaṁ, ", "ja496:2.4": "suciṁ maṁsūpasecanaṁ. ", "ja496:3.1": "Taṁ tvaṁ bhattaṁ paṭiggayha, ", "ja496:3.2": "brāhmaṇassa adāsayi; ", "ja496:3.3": "Attānaṁ anasitvāna, ", "ja496:3.4": "koyaṁ dhammo namatthu te”. ", "ja496:4.1": "“Ācariyo brāhmaṇo mayhaṁ, ", "ja496:4.2": "kiccākiccesu byāvaṭo; ", "ja496:4.3": "Garu ca āmantanīyo ca, ", "ja496:4.4": "dātumarahāmi bhojanaṁ”. ", "ja496:5.1": "“Brāhmaṇaṁ dāni pucchāmi, ", "ja496:5.2": "gotamaṁ rājapūjitaṁ; ", "ja496:5.3": "Rājā te bhattaṁ pādāsi, ", "ja496:5.4": "suciṁ maṁsūpasecanaṁ. ", "ja496:6.1": "Taṁ tvaṁ bhattaṁ paṭiggayha, ", "ja496:6.2": "isissa bhojanaṁ adā; ", "ja496:6.3": "Akhettaññūsi dānassa, ", "ja496:6.4": "koyaṁ dhammo namatthu te”. ", "ja496:7.1": "“Bharāmi puttadāre ca, ", "ja496:7.2": "gharesu gadhito ahaṁ; ", "ja496:7.3": "Bhuñje mānusake kāme, ", "ja496:7.4": "anusāsāmi rājino. ", "ja496:8.1": "Āraññikassa isino, ", "ja496:8.2": "cirarattaṁ tapassino; ", "ja496:8.3": "Vuḍḍhassa bhāvitattassa, ", "ja496:8.4": "dātumarahāmi bhojanaṁ”. ", "ja496:9.1": "“Isiñca dāni pucchāmi, ", "ja496:9.2": "kisaṁ dhamanisanthataṁ; ", "ja496:9.3": "Parūḷhakacchanakhalomaṁ, ", "ja496:9.4": "paṅkadantaṁ rajassiraṁ. ", "ja496:10.1": "Eko araññe viharasi, ", "ja496:10.2": "nāvakaṅkhasi jīvitaṁ; ", "ja496:10.3": "Bhikkhu kena tayā seyyo, ", "ja496:10.4": "yassa tvaṁ bhojanaṁ adā”. ", "ja496:11.1": "“Khaṇantālukalambāni, ", "ja496:11.2": "bilālitakkalāni ca; ", "ja496:11.3": "Dhunaṁ sāmākanīvāraṁ, ", "ja496:11.4": "saṅghāriyaṁ pasāriyaṁ. ", "ja496:12.1": "Sākaṁ bhisaṁ madhuṁ maṁsaṁ, ", "ja496:12.2": "Badarāmalakāni ca; ", "ja496:12.3": "Tāni āharitvā bhuñjāmi, ", "ja496:12.4": "Atthi me so pariggaho. ", "ja496:13.1": "Pacanto apacantassa, ", "ja496:13.2": "amamassa sakiñcano; ", "ja496:13.3": "Anādānassa sādāno, ", "ja496:13.4": "dātumarahāmi bhojanaṁ”. ", "ja496:14.1": "“Bhikkhuñca dāni pucchāmi, ", "ja496:14.2": "tuṇhīmāsīna subbataṁ; ", "ja496:14.3": "Isi te bhattaṁ pādāsi, ", "ja496:14.4": "suciṁ maṁsūpasecanaṁ. ", "ja496:15.1": "Taṁ tvaṁ bhattaṁ paṭiggayha, ", "ja496:15.2": "tuṇhī bhuñjasi ekako; ", "ja496:15.3": "Nāññaṁ kañci nimantesi, ", "ja496:15.4": "koyaṁ dhammo namatthu te”. ", "ja496:16.1": "“Na pacāmi na pācemi, ", "ja496:16.2": "na chindāmi na chedaye; ", "ja496:16.3": "Taṁ maṁ akiñcanaṁ ñatvā, ", "ja496:16.4": "sabbapāpehi ārataṁ. ", "ja496:17.1": "Vāmena bhikkhamādāya, ", "ja496:17.2": "dakkhiṇena kamaṇḍaluṁ; ", "ja496:17.3": "Isi me bhattaṁ pādāsi, ", "ja496:17.4": "suciṁ maṁsūpasecanaṁ. ", "ja496:18.1": "Ete hi dātumarahanti, ", "ja496:18.2": "samamā sapariggahā; ", "ja496:18.3": "Paccanīkamahaṁ maññe, ", "ja496:18.4": "yo dātāraṁ nimantaye”. ", "ja496:19.1": "“Atthāya vata me ajja, ", "ja496:19.2": "idhāgacchi rathesabho; ", "ja496:19.3": "Sohaṁ ajja pajānāmi, ", "ja496:19.4": "yattha dinnaṁ mahapphalaṁ. ", "ja496:20.1": "Raṭṭhesu giddhā rājāno, ", "ja496:20.2": "Kiccākiccesu brāhmaṇā; ", "ja496:20.3": "Isī mūlaphale giddhā, ", "ja496:20.4": "Vippamuttā ca bhikkhavo”ti. ", "ja496:21.1": "Bhikkhāparamparajātakaṁ terasamaṁ. ", "ja496:22.1": "Pakiṇṇakanipātaṁ niṭṭhitaṁ. ", "ja496:23.1": "Tassuddānaṁ ", "ja496:24.1": "Suva kinnara mukka kharājinaso, ", "ja496:24.2": "Bhisajāta mahesi kapotavaro; ", "ja496:24.3": "Atha mora satacchaka vāṇijako, ", "ja496:24.4": "Atha rāja sabrāhmaṇa bhikkhaparanti. "}, "variant_text": {"ja496:0.1": "", "ja496:0.2": "", "ja496:0.3": "", "ja496:0.4": "", "ja496:1.1": "disvā → disvāna (bj, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja496:1.2": "", "ja496:1.3": "", "ja496:1.4": "mahāsayanamupāsitaṁ → … mupocitaṁ (sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1, mr) ", "ja496:2.1": "", "ja496:2.2": "vaḍḍhamodanaṁ → baddhamodanaṁ (bj, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja496:2.3": "", "ja496:2.4": "", "ja496:3.1": "", "ja496:3.2": "adāsayi → apāpayi (bj); adāpayi (sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja496:3.3": "Attānaṁ → attanā (pts-vp-pli1 aṭṭhakathāyaṁ. pāṭhantaraṁ) ", "ja496:3.4": "", "ja496:4.1": "", "ja496:4.2": "byāvaṭo → vāvaṭo (mr) ", "ja496:4.3": "āmantanīyo → āmantaṇīyo (pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja496:4.4": "", "ja496:5.1": "", "ja496:5.2": "", "ja496:5.3": "", "ja496:5.4": "", "ja496:6.1": "", "ja496:6.2": "", "ja496:6.3": "", "ja496:6.4": "", "ja496:7.1": "puttadāre → putte dāre (bj, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja496:7.2": "gadhito → gathito (bj, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja496:7.3": "", "ja496:7.4": "", "ja496:8.1": "Āraññikassa → āraññakassa (bj, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja496:8.2": "", "ja496:8.3": "", "ja496:8.4": "", "ja496:9.1": "", "ja496:9.2": "", "ja496:9.3": "", "ja496:9.4": "", "ja496:10.1": "viharasi → vihāsi (mr) ", "ja496:10.2": "", "ja496:10.3": "", "ja496:10.4": "", "ja496:11.1": "Khaṇantālukalambāni → khaṇamālukalambāni (sya1ed, sya2ed, mr) ", "ja496:11.2": "bilālitakkalāni ca → biḷālitakkaḷāni ca (bj, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja496:11.3": "", "ja496:11.4": "saṅghāriyaṁ pasāriyaṁ → saṁhāriyaṁ pahāriyaṁ (sya1ed, sya2ed); saṁsāriyaṁ pasāriyaṁ (mr) ", "ja496:12.1": "", "ja496:12.2": "", "ja496:12.3": "āharitvā → āhatva (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed); ābhatva (pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja496:12.4": "", "ja496:13.1": "", "ja496:13.2": "sakiñcano → akiñcano (bj, mr) ", "ja496:13.3": "", "ja496:13.4": "", "ja496:14.1": "", "ja496:14.2": "", "ja496:14.3": "", "ja496:14.4": "", "ja496:15.1": "", "ja496:15.2": "", "ja496:15.3": "kañci → kiñci (mr) ", "ja496:15.4": "", "ja496:16.1": "", "ja496:16.2": "", "ja496:16.3": "", "ja496:16.4": "", "ja496:17.1": "", "ja496:17.2": "", "ja496:17.3": "", "ja496:17.4": "", "ja496:18.1": "", "ja496:18.2": "", "ja496:18.3": "", "ja496:18.4": "", "ja496:19.1": "", "ja496:19.2": "", "ja496:19.3": "Sohaṁ ajja pajānāmi → ito pubbe na pajānāmi (bj); ito pubbe na jānāmi (pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja496:19.4": "", "ja496:20.1": "", "ja496:20.2": "", "ja496:20.3": "", "ja496:20.4": "", "ja496:21.1": "", "ja496:22.1": "", "ja496:23.1": "", "ja496:24.1": "", "ja496:24.2": "", "ja496:24.3": "", "ja496:24.4": ""}, "reference_text": {"ja496:0.1": "", "ja496:0.2": "", "ja496:0.3": "", "ja496:0.4": "", "ja496:1.1": "bj30.532, ms22J_2829, msdiv270, ndp22.302, pts-vp-pli4.371", "ja496:1.2": "", "ja496:1.3": "", "ja496:1.4": "", "ja496:2.1": "csp1ed22.307, csp2ed22.307, ms22J_2830, msdiv271", "ja496:2.2": "", "ja496:2.3": "", "ja496:2.4": "", "ja496:3.1": "ms22J_2831, msdiv272, sya27.406", "ja496:3.2": "", "ja496:3.3": "", "ja496:3.4": "", "ja496:4.1": "ms22J_2832, msdiv273", "ja496:4.2": "", "ja496:4.3": "", "ja496:4.4": "", "ja496:5.1": "ms22J_2833, msdiv274", "ja496:5.2": "", "ja496:5.3": "", "ja496:5.4": "", "ja496:6.1": "ms22J_2834, msdiv275", "ja496:6.2": "", "ja496:6.3": "", "ja496:6.4": "", "ja496:7.1": "ms22J_2835, msdiv276", "ja496:7.2": "", "ja496:7.3": "", "ja496:7.4": "", "ja496:8.1": "dr27.407, ms22J_2836, msdiv277", "ja496:8.2": "", "ja496:8.3":